# Written by Claude Code — infrastructure, not analysis
#
# sealed/answer_key.json records SHA-256 hashes of these files as they were when the generator ran,
# and acceptance check 10 compares against them. Line-ending conversion on checkout would change
# the bytes and break that check, so each file is pinned to the line endings it was hashed with.
# Do not change these lines, and do not renormalise these files.
generator/*.py                 text eol=lf
config/generator_ranges.yaml   text eol=crlf
config/policy.yaml             text eol=crlf
